WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
We need to get rid of this leaky window as soon as possible

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:11,790
Let me see how today's joke came about

3
00:00:11,790 --> 00:00:13,790
What is the strength after enhancement?

4
00:00:13,790 --> 00:00:25,420
It was actually dropped out of thin air

5
00:00:25,420 --> 00:00:29,000
Today’s attack method has become random

6
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:42,740
Is this the defensive power of the Four Seasons Gate?

7
00:00:42,740 --> 00:00:43,740
Sure enough

8
00:00:43,740 --> 00:00:45,740
On this second day, it was simply reduced to a blow.

9
00:00:45,740 --> 00:00:47,740
The resources invested are not wasted

10
00:00:47,740 --> 00:00:48,740
Not broken at all

11
00:00:48,740 --> 00:00:50,740
There's no way to tell how much the monster has become stronger
